 see what you put up on the screen but  let's go through the the things that  we're doing so we have a category called  turnbacks and we've turned back  tens of thousands of migrants who tried  to get across the border and we denied  them even coming across the border uh  once they cross the border we now have  two options one is uh to arrest them uh  and we we've made tens of thousands of  arrests uh for people and uh put them in  jail uh and and now we have this new  tool where we are now returning them to  the border all of these are completely  unprecedented no state in the history of  the united states of america has ever  done this and maria of course that's on  top of doing things like texas being the  only state in american history to build  our own border wall texas being the only  state in history uh where we have laid  down mile after mile after mile razor  wire  as barrier to prevent people from coming  in so texas is using every tool and  strategy that we can it is time now for  congress to step up under article 1  section 8 of the united states  constitution congress has the direct  authority to call for an invasion and to  do something about securing our border  it's time now for congress to stop  talking about it and step up and do  something about it  all right i want to get your take on uh  this investigation into texas border  security mission but first what is your  reaction to the president of mexico  lopez obrador endorsing your democrat  opponent beto o'rourke in the governor's  race this november obviously this is joe  biden's pick now you've got the  president of mexico uh endorsing beta  o'rourke  there's a reason for it and that is all  of these illegal immigrants coming from  mexico into texas they are allowed into  mexico by president uh lopez obrador and  they're coming from countries across the  entire world for one uh president lopez  obrador he could keep them out of mexico  if he wanted to but he does not want to  he wants to funnel them into the state  of texas maria can you imagine anything  worse in the united states of america  than than having lopez obrador working  with joe biden working with beto or work  those three with the open border  policies my fellow americans it would be  a disaster a crushing disaster from  which we may never recover uh if beto or  working hand-in-hand with joe biden and  the president of mexico on open border  policies in the state of texas it would  destroy our country  meanwhile instead of going to the border  and dealing with these issues president  biden's uh doj is investigating your  state and operation lone star  they're talking about potential civil  rights violations in uh that they  received indications that texas dps is  targeting certain individuals for arrest  on the basis of race and national origin  governor what is your response  maria you know i'm a former texas  supreme court justice as well as the  former texas attorney general everything  that we do  we make sure is consistent with state  and federal law this is nothing more  than a political attack by the byte  administration because byte  administration does not want us to try  to stop his open border policies and so  we are frustrating the about  administration's open border policies  and they're using any tool and strategy  they can to try to tamp down texas  efforts to enforce the immigration laws  and to secure our border  yeah and yet he won't visit the border  but he will visit saudi arabia in the  upcoming week he's trying to get the  saudis to put more oil on the market  even though texas is oil and gas rich  tell us about uh texas's potential to  produce enough oil to reduce pain at the  pump and and eliminate the need to go  hand in hand in saudi arabia  i mean it is so embarrassing and so  two-faced by the bible administration  going off to saudi arabia begging for  them to produce more oil when we have  the oil right here in the state of texas  texas is one of the if not the most  prolific producer of oil in the entire  world and all we need is uh the permits  from the buying administration the  authorization uh to build more  refineries uh we could be producing the  gasoline that would lower price of the  pump if the byte administration would  unleash  the american oil and gas ingenuity and  we could produce all the oil that we  need and get this as you probably know  president biden took oil from the  federal strategic oil reserves and  shipped it to other countries across the  globe as opposed to keeping it into the  united states and refining it here  turning into gasoline biden is one of  the reasons why we have such high  gasoline prices  well that's right and we are going to be  talking about the fact that some of that  oil actually went to china our largest  adversary real quick before you go all  of this is not falling on deaf ears we  just saw representative maida flores uh  flip a seat in an 84 hispanic district  in texas do you believe this is going to  see  we'll see more of this going into the  november elections and will we see the  border states  voters react  this will be a massive  right this is going to be a massive red  wave along the border the border  counties and the border districts have  historically always been democrat uh the  one that myra foreign won was always  held by a democrat is now held by a  republican we will see other republican  victories along the border i will do  extraordinarily well on the border it's  because so many people on the border are  so angry about the blind  administration's approach to the open  border policies and they're going to be  voting against the bite administration  voting for republicans who they know  it's going to be the republicans who are  stepping up securing our border  all right governor good to have you this  morning thanks very much for your  efforts we'll keep following it texas  governor greg abbott this morning in  texas thank you

